| # | Author | Surviving lines | Share | Commits | Commit share |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | Max Bruckner | 2,699 | 75.1% | 636 | 66.5% |
| 2 | Kevin Branigan | 149 | 4.1% | 7 | 0.7% |
| 3 | Alan Wang | 129 | 3.6% | 62 | 6.5% |
