I ran `git blame` on the current HEAD of both files. That gave 3,601 lines in total (3,298 in `.c`, 303 in `.h`). I used `-w -M -C` so whitespace-only changes and moved lines don't reassign credit. I also passed `.git-blame-ignore-revs`, so the clang-format commit `413c6d1` doesn't take credit. Results were identical with and without the ignore file, because `-w` already skips that reformat.

